## 2. Generate the IP salt (on your Mac)\
\
```bash\
openssl rand -hex 32\
```\
\
Copy the long hex string. That\'92s `VOICE_LAB_IP_SALT`.  \
Store it somewhere safe (1Password / notes). Don\'92t rotate casually later \'97 every visitor\'92s bucket is keyed off it.\
\
