\
## 3. Add all three on Vercel \'97 Production only\
\
1. [vercel.com](https://vercel.com) 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  your **RepurposeOne / Voiceora** project  \
2. **Settings** 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  **Environment Variables**  \
3. Add each of these. For each one, check **only Production** (leave Preview / Development unchecked unless you want them there too):\
\
| Name | Value | Notes |\
|------|--------|--------|\
| `VOICE_LAB_IP_SALT` | output of `openssl rand -hex 32` | Secret \'97 not `NEXT_PUBLIC_` |\
| `TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY` | Cloudflare secret key | Secret |\
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY` | Cloudflare site key | Public (baked into the client bundle) |\
